## Rule: canonical vs pointer

| Kind | Rule | Examples |
|------|------|----------|
| **Canonical** | Owns the truth; update here when behavior changes | `PRODUCT_REFERENCE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, `AUDIT.md` |
| **Pointer / hub** | Links only; **no** duplicated tables or backlog rows | `IMPROVEMENT_BACKLOG.md` |
| **Thin rule (`.mdc`)** | Triggers + short text; **must link** to canonical doc | project rules under `.cursor/rules/` |
| **Archive** | Historical; not current policy | `docs/audit_archive/`, design archive folders |

