## Product-truth owners (Step 3b)

Update these when **runtime behavior** changes (paths, capabilities, limits, install modes). Version-string sync alone is not enough — see `%USERPROFILE%\.cursor\AgentStarterPack\pack\docs\WORK_COMPLETION.md` Step 3.

| Role | Path | Notes |
|------|------|-------|
| Capabilities / agent obligations | `docs/PRODUCT_REFERENCE.md` | Create when the app has a capability reference |
| Accepted tradeoffs / limits | `docs/KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md` | Not bugs — intentional tradeoffs |
| Product plan / build order | `docs/ROADMAP.md` | Work queue + Approved intent (if used) |
| Layout / runtime paths | `PROJECT_LAYOUT.md` or README install section | Paths users and agents rely on |
| Maintainer process radar | `docs/WORK_QUEUE.md` | WQ ids — not the same as ROADMAP product queue |
| Optional doc/code claims | `docs/.product_truth_verify.json` | Copy from `pack/templates/docs/product_truth_verify.json.example` |

Project overlay: `docs/WORK_COMPLETION.md` lists the same paths for your machine after bootstrap.

